 - 2026-08-14: Operational retrospective for 2026.08.553: execution accounting covers 12 completions across 86 minutes, divided into 6 compute-bound and 6 synthesis-only experiments. The readiness-dependent constraint-saturation factor task heads the shown compute rows at 1 minute, but its internal timing is unavailable. The idle device snapshot does not override the locked false task-idle indicator, so compute-period utilization cannot be scored; loaded-model concurrency is also absent, preventing a DualGPURunner determination. The highest-leverage tooling change is deterministic CPU sharding with phase checkpoints for the long synthesis workflow, accompanied by task-linked device and dispatch receipts. Estimated savings is 0% without a measured alternate run. Artifact: results/operational_retro_2026_08_553.json.
 - 2026-08-15: V553 terminal handoff and V554 queue preflight (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete_blocked_v554_queue_incomplete: V553 terminal facts are preserved but the activated V554 queue contains 9 of 12 required tasks; results/experiment_6436_v554_terminal_handoff_and_queue_preflight.json
 - 2026-08-15: Independent continuous self-learning lifecycle row-recomputation audit (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete_blocked: V554 CSL lifecycle recomputation audit blocked by missing or failed upstream evidence; results/experiment_6444_csl_lifecycle_recomputation_audit.json
+- 2026-08-15: Operational retrospective for 2026.08.554: All 5 recorded experiments resolve to 0.0 minutes, including 3 compute-bound entries, so the compute rows tie and no duration cause is measurable. The locked compute-task idle field is false; the uncorrelated idle GPU snapshot therefore does not establish a utilization fault. The data also provides no concurrent-model or runner receipt, so no DualGPURunner miss can be found. The next milestone should use readiness-aware dispatch plus task-linked phase, GPU, model-count, and runner receipts. Estimated savings: 0%, because the data contains no measured counterfactual. Artifact: results/operational_retro_2026_08_554.json.
